msgid "Emlid Reach RTK GPS Receiver"
msgstr "Emlid Reach RTK GPS 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:7
#: 4579fd71940b46da86d9f5e723d166f3 6cb7bcdad6d84a84a9ad042bfa76d528
#: 90828eaa4d654792921142f90ed25c6b 91d0a31f54d34bb0bad2d18aac6034ae
#: d9b62c06e5d344b8adc08aab624f7f0f
msgid "This article provides a brief overview of Reach RTK GPS receiver."
msgstr "本文简要介绍 Reach RTK GPS 接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:14
#: 27f335f69f4a4f9eb888178bfae588b0 309c2baa358a4c4ea1069ae99f88421c
#: 3669bf4224f54ff39601b3931e9c83ae 71e995d512214abea5abf95e01ff5a93
#: a1c696a455534cd3829028f7bfe7c8d6
msgid "What is Reach and what is it for?"
msgstr "Reach 是什么，有什么用途？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:16
#: 08baee2e18f247c9abc897d706d5220b 3423d8671a544efb9f75de6323509df7
#: 6fb008c92ec746efb188c96df0bb8b59 9013228cd5344a0486dddff26d2f2cba
#: d07373dda3694f878aee91d40cf5cbc2
msgid ""
"Reach is an RTK GNSS receiver for applications when your standard GPS with "
"several meters accuracy just won't cut it. It relies on RTK (real-time "
"kinematics) technology to deliver centimeter level accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Reach 是一款 RTK GNSS 接收机，适用于普通 GPS 精度（数米级）无法满足要求的场合。它依托 "
"RTK（实时动态定位）技术，提供厘米级定位精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:18
#: 026a7137dfd94202a148ae1783293e8a 69022a40390244a5a1812ebef3421724
#: 7ee47c69ec05472b88184b126d29a2f8 8044b92aa83544bd8b7192c3c9029f4f
#: 8f472225da4947fc9d803122c8714f83
msgid ""
"RTK has historically been used primarily by surveyors and others who "
"required centimeter precise positioning, and were able to spend thousands of"
" dollars on an RTK system. Reach makes this same functionality affordable to"
" hobbyists and makers."
msgstr ""
"RTK 在历史上主要被测量人员和其他需要厘米级定位精度的专业人士使用，通常需要花费数千美元购置 RTK 系统。Reach "
"使这一功能对爱好者和创客而言价格更为亲民。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:20
#: 7f235401941c4840aff47dc3f8d6724d 88cd81eeed844286b539402939c33641
#: a6b9f8c31e4f4784bb0309658f8d47e1 c18aba79ed1b4e5da19ea8f0ced558c9
#: daea8cbf5d924dd58852433721b373a9
msgid ""
"Reach runs open-source RTK processing software called RTKLIB written by "
"Tomoji Takasu. Previously a computer was required to run RTKLIB, but now all"
" RTKLIB features are available directly on Reach."
msgstr ""
"Reach 运行由 Tomoji Takasu 编写的开源 RTK 处理软件 RTKLIB。此前需要电脑才能运行 RTKLIB，而现在所有 RTKLIB"
" 功能均可直接在 Reach 上使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:22
#: 385bcf6d13b6454384255459e88b558d 61e605c3cd5240a3affea2b9b287ef90
#: 91a4a77547e746269e0fa9f73c8b6e00 c22149436795499b84f1010bea9b19d0
#: da9bae8ddc9e4523b011c51898c962a0
msgid ""
"For further information see `Reach documentation "
"<https://docs.emlid.com/reach/>`__."
msgstr "更多信息请参阅 `Reach 文档 <https://docs.emlid.com/reach/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:25
#: c06c1657439f496ea4c561cabd46bee5 d12d7896e07a41b28a0d4b4488c05cc9
#: f66e49388c804aee8752529df1f8f5d0 fec539ed412d4c34b360de173e4a858a
#: ff04483808c845c39fb79d14b643b656
msgid "ArduPilot integration"
msgstr "与 ArduPilot 集成"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:27
#: 152b01b2d18e4fda8e5b6ff2d374890c 3a651e86b51d431ebb2975b4fd2529c5
#: 52f66c97c9a24c04870d15d2cf0fa8b2 69633c6cdf2c4206b93ddfe41ec4ac75
#: cc9d36491acc4cc8bd266d12a4491152
msgid ""
"Reach supports RTK-enhanced coordinates output to ArduPilot based "
"autopilots. To make this possible, it uses a custom GPS protocol called ERB "
"(Emlid Reach Binary protocol)."
msgstr ""
"Reach 支持向基于 ArduPilot 的飞控输出 RTK 增强坐标。为实现这一功能，它使用了一种名为 ERB（Emlid Reach Binary"
" 协议）的自定义 GPS 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:29
