#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:37
#: 190a261c5106434fbccf9d3e57123179 704c474631a6480c8b3b23857c154b20
#: a5764797f15c44679a24012fd40dda79 ca4688a0dc48452ba1a0b74e8ee57984
#: cf171ad3ab654ad48e4dad7fe6790c2b
msgid ""
"A Reach unit mounted on the vehicle can receive base corrections over "
"telemetry radio, thus not requiring a separate correction link to the drone."
" Coordinate output is implemented via a serial port."
msgstr "安装在飞行器上的 Reach 设备可通过数传电台接收基站差分数据，因此无需为无人机单独配备差分数据链路。坐标输出通过串口实现。"

